  "description": "A LinkML rendering of the FINOS Common Domain Model (CDM): every type, choice, enumeration and type alias its Rosetta source declares, one module per Rosetta namespace, with the conditions LinkML can state.",
  "title": "FINOS Common Domain Model",
  "comments": [
    "Written by scripts/rosetta_to_linkml.py from FINOS's Rosetta files at the tag in source; edit the script, never the modules. The descriptions are the CDM's own, carried under the Community Specification License 1.0 with the attribution NOTICE gives."
  ],
  "source": "https://github.com/finos/common-domain-model/tree/8.0.0-dev.13",
  "see_also": [
