        },
        {
          "text": "BRL.PCOT-COMMERCIAL/BRL03",
          "description": "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Brazilian Real/U.S. Dollar commercial rate, expressed as the amount of Brazilian Reais per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement in two Business Days (where such days are Business Days in both Sao Paulo and New York) reported by the Banco Central do Brasil on SISBACEN Data System under transaction code PCOT- 390, Option 3, at the Specified Time, if any, on that Rate Calculation Date.",
          "aliases": [
