        {
          "text": "BRL.PTAX-COMMERCIAL.BRFR/BRL06",
          "description": "The Spot Rate for a Rate Calculation Date will be the Brazilian Real/U.S. Dollar commercial rate, expressed as the amount of Brazilian Reais per one U.S. Dollar, for settlement in two Business Days (where such days are Business Days in both Sao Paulo and New York) reported by the Banco Central do Brasil which appears on the Reuters Screen BRFR Page at PTAX-800 as of 11:00 a.m., Sao Paulo time, on the first Business Day following that Rate Calculation Date. 23",
          "aliases": [
