      "description": "An Asset that exists only in digital form, eg Bitcoin or Ethereum, that is not backed by other Assets; excludes the digital representation of other Assets, eg coins or Tokenised assets.",
      "from_schema": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/cdm_base_staticdata_asset_common",
