        "Rosetta condition SpecifiedAdditionalTerminationEvent is not stated in LinkML: if additionalTerminationEvent any = AdditionalTerminationEventEnum -> AsSpecified then specifiedAdditionalTerminationEvent exists else specifiedAdditionalTerminationEvent is absent"
