      "description": "Security finance payout specification in case the product payout involves some form of security collateral, as in a securities financing transaction. Plus additional description for ICMA.",
      "comments": [
        "Rosetta condition UnderlierNotCash is not stated in LinkML: underlier as Cash is absent",
        "Rosetta condition SettlementCentreRequired is not stated in LinkML: if underlier as Security exists then (settlementTerms -> securitySettlementCentre exists and settlementTerms -> cashSettlementCentre exists)"
      ],
      "from_schema": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/cdm_product_template",
