    {
      "name": "TradableProduct",
      "definition_uri": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/common-domain-model/TradableProduct",
      "description": "Definition of a product as ready to be traded, i.e. included in an execution or contract, by associating a specific price and quantity to this product plus an (optional) mechanism for any potential future quantity adjustment.",
      "comments": [
        "Rosetta condition NotionalAdjustment is not stated in LinkML: if adjustment exists then product -> economicTerms -> payout as PerformancePayout -> returnTerms -> priceReturnTerms exists or product -> economicTerms -> payout as PerformancePayout exists",
        "Rosetta condition PerformancePayout_ExtraordinaryDividendsParty is not stated in LinkML: if product -> economicTerms -> payout as PerformancePayout -> returnTerms -> dividendReturnTerms -> extraordinaryDividendsParty exists then ancillaryParty -> role contains AncillaryRoleEnum -> ExtraordinaryDividendsParty and if ancillaryParty -> role contains AncillaryRoleEnum -> ExtraordinaryDividendsParty then product -> economicTerms -> payout as PerformancePayout -> returnTerms -> dividendReturnTerms -> extraordinaryDividendsParty exists",
        "Rosetta condition OptionPayout_PredeterminedClearingOrganizationParty is not stated in LinkML: if product -> economicTerms -> payout as OptionPayout -> settlementTerms -> physicalSettlementTerms -> predeterminedClearingOrganizationParty exists then ancillaryParty -> role contains AncillaryRoleEnum -> PredeterminedClearingOrganizationParty",
        "Rosetta condition ForwardPayout_PredeterminedClearingOrganizationParty is not stated in LinkML: if product -> economicTerms -> payout as SettlementPayout -> settlementTerms -> physicalSettlementTerms -> predeterminedClearingOrganizationParty exists then ancillaryParty -> role contains AncillaryRoleEnum -> PredeterminedClearingOrganizationParty",
        "Rosetta condition PredeterminedClearingOrganizationParty is not stated in LinkML: if ancillaryParty -> role contains AncillaryRoleEnum -> PredeterminedClearingOrganizationParty then product -> economicTerms -> payout as SettlementPayout -> settlementTerms -> physicalSettlementTerms -> predeterminedClearingOrganizationParty exists or product -> economicTerms -> payout as OptionPayout -> settlementTerms -> physicalSettlementTerms -> predeterminedClearingOrganizationParty exists",
